  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the tandoor clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the ghee and let it melt.",
    "Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add the lardons and cook until they are crispy.",
    "Add the dried shrimp and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the basmati rice and stir well to combine with the shrimp and lardons.",
    "Add the coriander powder, turmeric powder, and salt, and stir well.",
    "Add 2 cups of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the pot, and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Fluff the biryani with a fork and stir in the chopped cilantro and lemon juice."
